3.5.4-gp8-archive-trace
- Baseline: 3.5.4-gp7-streamresync.
- Preserved gp7 USB timeout/EPIPE/reopen/stream-resync behavior.
- Added structured startup archive recovery tracing and gap accounting.
- Added duplicate/out-of-order archive diagnostics and final recovery summary.
- Sub-minute archive anomalies are dropped without aborting recovery.
- Added asynchronous rotating driver_file_log.
- Diagnostic logs limited to 10 MB + 4 backups each by default.
